1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,039
Mark the young root with evenly spaced ink lines and come back a day later.

2
00:00:05,039 --> 00:00:10,208
The marks in the zone of elongation have spread far apart; the others hardly moved.

3
00:00:10,208 --> 00:00:13,372
That is where most of the measurable lengthening happens.

